#12817
An Old and Broken Battlefield~
   The ground is carpeted with the rusted remnants of an ancient battle.
Broken spears, shattered shields, and dented helms lie half-buried in dark ash,
a silent farm of fallen arms stretching as far as the eye can see. A rough
scraping noise follows every footstep as you trod along, watching as loose bits
of iron slowly creep across the ground, drawn to the shape at the center.
Commands: return
~
aci 0 0 12817
E
ground carpet~
   Rare hints of green poke through the ash and armor that carpet the
battlefield where eons of endless war have left little natural ground exposed.
~
E
remnants~
From horizon to horizon, all you can see is what remains of endless war.
~
E
rust~
A soft blanket of dark red covers many of the fallen arms and armor.
~
E
spears shields helms arms armor weapons~
All around you are the rusted remains of battle.
~
E
ash farm~
Old weapons rise from the field of ash like so many crops.
~
E
iron~
Everything here is made of iron.
~
E
shape center mass hulking~
There's a hulking mass at the center of the battlefield.
~
