#12850
A Cluttered Siege Pavilion~
   The tent is crowded with the tools of war, its canvas walls bowed inward by
hanging maps, tally boards, and rolls of marked parchment. Long tables sag
beneath stone weights, carved tokens standing in for regiments on plots of the
battlefield. The light flickers off of fresh ink, wax seals, and bits of soot
as lanterns swing from the central poles. Outside there's a general silence,
punctuated by the ring of hammers against hard anvils.
Commands: return
~
cei 0 0 12850
D5
~
0 12851
E
pavilion tent canvas walls~
