#12851
Victory Forge~
   At the heart of Victory Forge rises a squat smelting furnace, glowing
white-hot at its mouth, burning steady despite the night air. Heat ripples
outward from it, warping shadows cast by the lanterns. The furnace breathes a
fiery roar that drowns out the silence of the battlefield, punctuated by the
rhythmic ringing of the anvils.
