darkened by soot and dew. Barrels of charcoal and oil sit wedged between weapon
blanks and bundled hafts, all arranged with the tidy severity of a war camp. A
clean water barrel rests near the supplies with a ladle to drink from. The
battlefield below lies quiet and still, blanketed by a light fog.
