#12890
Above Echo Forge~
   No sound echoes out as you step onto a raised tile platform beneath a starry
night sky. A brick-filled archway stands at one end of the small platform; the
other side has a twisting metal staircase that leads downward. As you look out,
you see a massive wall enclosing a circular area below you. Something beneath
the platform glows bright enough to cast shadows, but you can't see it from
here. The rest of the circle's interior is dark, but an occasional flash
illuminates shadowy figures working at anvils.
Commands: return
~
cei b 0 12890
D9
~
0 12891
