#12891
Echo Forge~
   Beneath the raised platform is a brilliant white bell, glowing like a star
such that you can't look at it for long. It floats in the air above a small,
engraved dais. Near the bell, a twisting staircase leads back up to the
platform. The floor here is made of large tiles, apparently metal, but there is
no sound as you step. There's no sound here at all, not even from the artisans
working the anvils around you. Beyond them, in the distance, is a great, round
wall too high to see over and too dark to make out from here.
Commands: challenge
