Echo Forge~
   A large, round anvil rests between two pools of water beneath the endless
starry night. A momentary flash of white light bursts forth each time Ixchel
strikes the anvil, but it makes no sound. Behind the anvil, a tall archway
marks the boundary of the metal tile floor. And beyond that, blocking your
view, is the great circular wall.
Commands: forge, smelt, shatter <item to destroy>
~
